# The queue is keyed by id, so a file that opens frontmatter without one could
# never be offered, matched to a branch, or read for its guard. It refuses
# rather than going unseen while other tasks are offered around it.
run available
exit 3
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/zzz.md
	---
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: yes
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/zzz.md: frontmatter has no id
